{"seq":2,"slug":"gacha-battle-pass","title":"抽卡与战斗通行证","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-monetization-liveops/monetization-design/gacha-battle-pass","wordCount":1407,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"抽卡与战斗通行证\">抽卡与战斗通行证</h1><p>当今收入最高的免费游戏，几乎都靠两种付费结构撑起：抽卡用随机性制造稀缺与惊喜，让玩家为「也许下一次就出」而反复掏钱；战斗通行证用一条看得见的奖励轨道，把付费变成一个赛季的长期承诺。前者赌的是概率与情绪，后者卖的是确定与陪伴。这两种机制的概率数学与价值结构，是本篇的核心，也是整个 hub 里这套计算的唯一详述处。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>抽卡与通行证看似无关，实则是同一付费光谱的两端：一端是高方差、强情绪、付费无上限的随机抽取，另一端是低方差、可预期、付费有边界的进度解锁。下图把它们放在一起对照。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[高收入付费结构] --&gt; B[抽卡 Gacha]&#10;  A --&gt; C[战斗通行证 Battle Pass]&#10;  B --&gt; B1[随机抽取]&#10;  B1 --&gt; B2[保底机制 Pity]&#10;  B1 --&gt; B3[概率公示]&#10;  B2 --&gt; B4[付费无上限&lt;br/&gt;面向鲸鱼]&#10;  C --&gt; C1[免费轨 + 付费轨]&#10;  C1 --&gt; C2[每日/每周任务]&#10;  C2 --&gt; C3[赛季进度]&#10;  C3 --&gt; C4[付费有边界&lt;br/&gt;面向海豚]\">flowchart TD\n  A[高收入付费结构] --&gt; B[抽卡 Gacha]\n  A --&gt; C[战斗通行证 Battle Pass]\n  B --&gt; B1[随机抽取]\n  B1 --&gt; B2[保底机制 Pity]\n  B1 --&gt; B3[概率公示]\n  B2 --&gt; B4[付费无上限&lt;br/&gt;面向鲸鱼]\n  C --&gt; C1[免费轨 + 付费轨]\n  C1 --&gt; C2[每日/每周任务]\n  C2 --&gt; C3[赛季进度]\n  C3 --&gt; C4[付费有边界&lt;br/&gt;面向海豚]</pre><p>下表对比两种机制的关键属性。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>属性</th>\n<th>抽卡</th>\n<th>战斗通行证</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>收入方差</td>\n<td>高（看脸）</td>\n<td>低（可预期）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>付费上限</td>\n<td>无上限</td>\n<td>单赛季固定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主要面向</td>\n<td>鲸鱼</td>\n<td>海豚、活跃玩家</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>心理驱动</td>\n<td>稀缺、惊喜、损失厌恶</td>\n<td>进度、承诺、不舍浪费</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>留存绑定</td>\n<td>中（追新池）</td>\n<td>强（每日任务）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"抽卡的概率与期望值\">抽卡的概率与期望值</h2><p>抽卡的本质是付费随机抽取。设单抽抽到目标稀有物的概率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>，那么连抽 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 次至少出一次的概率为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>至少一次</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(\\text{至少一次}) = 1 - (1 - p)^n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">至少一次</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 很小时，期望抽中所需次数约为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.006</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p = 0.006</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.006</span></span></span></span></span>（常见的限定 UP 角色基础概率），期望约需 167 抽才出一个——这正是高方差与付费无上限的来源：运气差的玩家可能抽几百次仍空手，而每一抽都要花钱。这种「沉没成本 + 也许下一次」的组合，对情绪的牵引极强，也正因如此，它是<a href=\"../analytics-ethics/ethics-regulation\">伦理、成瘾与合规</a>重点审视的对象。</p>\n<h2 id=\"保底机制-给随机性装上天花板\">保底机制：给随机性装上天花板</h2><p>纯粹的随机会让倒霉玩家无限投入而一无所获，既伤体验也招监管。现代抽卡普遍引入保底（pity）：累计抽到一定次数必出，把最坏情况封顶。设软保底从第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 抽起概率线性抬升、硬保底在第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 抽必出，则玩家的期望抽数被显著压缩、方差也随之收敛。保底的设计是一门平衡术——封顶设得太低，鲸鱼无处可花；设得太高，普通玩家望而却步。下表是一个典型的双重保底参数示例。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>触发条件</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n<th>设计意图</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>基础概率</td>\n<td>每抽</td>\n<td>0.6% 出 UP</td>\n<td>制造稀缺</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>软保底</td>\n<td>第 74 抽起</td>\n<td>概率逐抽抬升</td>\n<td>收敛方差</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>硬保底</td>\n<td>第 90 抽</td>\n<td>必出</td>\n<td>封顶最坏情况</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大保底</td>\n<td>连续两个十连歪</td>\n<td>下次必为 UP</td>\n<td>安抚非洲玩家</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>保底既是体验保护，也是合规要求——很多地区已要求公示概率并限制最坏投入，这与<a href=\"../analytics-ethics/ethics-regulation\">伦理、成瘾与合规</a>讲的监管直接挂钩。抽卡所需的货币，则来自<a href=\"iap-virtual-goods\">内购与虚拟商品</a>里设计的商店。</p>\n<h2 id=\"战斗通行证-把付费变成承诺\">战斗通行证：把付费变成承诺</h2><p>战斗通行证（Battle Pass）走的是另一条路：它给出一条贯穿整个赛季的奖励轨道，分免费轨与付费轨。玩家通过每日、每周任务积累经验点解锁层级，付费玩家额外获得付费轨的丰厚奖励。通行证的天才之处在于它把付费从「单次冲动」变成「赛季承诺」——一旦买了通行证，玩家就有强烈动机每天回来完成任务，不让已付的钱浪费。</p>\n<p>这套结构对留存的拉动极强。Fortnite 把通行证发扬光大，其活跃玩家在 90 天后的留存率高达 78%，远超同类（<a href=\"https://explore.st-aug.edu/exp/fortnites-battle-pass-evolution-how-a-single-game-shaped-live-service-gaming\">St. Augustine&#39;s University, 2026</a>）。通行证设计的两个关键参数是：完成所需的活跃强度（太松没有承诺感，太紧变成负担），以及付费轨的回报感（许多通行证会让满级返还的硬通货足够买下一季，制造「不亏」的循环）。通行证与每日任务深度绑定，这把它和<a href=\"../liveops/retention-engagement\">留存与参与度</a>讲的习惯回路直接连在一起；它作为一件商品如何上架，则属于<a href=\"iap-virtual-goods\">内购与虚拟商品</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"两种机制的协同\">两种机制的协同</h2><p>成熟的产品不会二选一，而是让抽卡与通行证各司其职：通行证负责覆盖广大的活跃玩家与海豚，提供稳定、可预期的中等收入和强留存；抽卡负责为鲸鱼提供几乎无封顶的消费空间，贡献收入尖峰。一个赛季的典型节奏是——通行证作为「常驻基本盘」每季滚动，抽卡限定池作为「脉冲」配合版本更新上线，制造收入高峰。这种节奏的编排，正是第三章<a href=\"../liveops/liveops-events\">活动与版本节奏</a>的工作。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>抽卡与通行证是同一付费光谱的两端：高方差无上限 vs 低方差有边界。</li>\n<li>抽卡概率：连抽至少一次为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1-(1-p)^n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，小概率下期望抽数约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>，是高方差之源。</li>\n<li>保底机制（软/硬/大保底）给随机性封顶，既保护体验又满足合规。</li>\n<li>战斗通行证把付费变成赛季承诺，靠每日任务强力拉动留存，常设「满级返还」循环。</li>\n<li>两种机制协同：通行证守基本盘与留存，抽卡为鲸鱼制造收入尖峰。</li>\n<li>本篇是 hub 内抽卡概率与通行证价值计算的唯一详述处。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"抽卡与战斗通行证","id":"抽卡与战斗通行证"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"抽卡的概率与期望值","id":"抽卡的概率与期望值"},{"level":2,"text":"保底机制：给随机性装上天花板","id":"保底机制-给随机性装上天花板"},{"level":2,"text":"战斗通行证：把付费变成承诺","id":"战斗通行证-把付费变成承诺"},{"level":2,"text":"两种机制的协同","id":"两种机制的协同"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"内购与虚拟商品","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-monetization-liveops/monetization-design/iap-virtual-goods"},"next":{"title":"广告变现与混合变现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-monetization-liveops/monetization-design/ads-hybrid"}}